    "intent": {
      "values": [
        "apriltag-python 启动脚本未导出原生库目录致子进程加载失败"
      ],
      "source": "agent_note"
    },
    "symptoms": [
      {
        "id": "s-72747f326d4fa717",
        "stage": "session",
        "state": "observed",
        "text": "验证启动脚本收了原生库目录参数却不导出 LD_LIBRARY_PATH，子进程环境为空，依赖 libapriltag.so 的导入仍报 Error loading shared library，3 项启动测试全败。",
        "source": "agent_note",
        "evidence_refs": [
          "sha256:63b02ed3758f4c7ef5ff29eeec64d394d78e30f630f0a9f0c2a7d41f2ac8c1dd",
          "sha256:c45311a48319d3bc4c61de2c6976eea76086867997df87a8e2ed7a56459fa968"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "diagnosis": {
      "claims": [
        {
          "type": "root_cause",
          "text": "musl 只按动态链接器搜索路径解析 DT_NEEDED，且 LD_LIBRARY_PATH 仅在进程启动时读一次；父 shell 不导出则 python 内赋值、RTLD_GLOBAL 预加载都无效。",
          "source": "agent_note",
          "status": "hypothesis",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "sha256:63b02ed3758f4c7ef5ff29eeec64d394d78e30f630f0a9f0c2a7d41f2ac8c1dd",
            "sha256:c45311a48319d3bc4c61de2c6976eea76086867997df87a8e2ed7a56459fa968"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "generalization",
          "text": "在 exec 前加 export LD_LIBRARY_PATH=\"$native_dir${LD_LIBRARY_PATH:+:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH}\"：前置目录、不留空分量；换库时按该库自身 site-packages/<pkg> 重定位 native_dir 再传参，用原命令复跑。",
          "source": "agent_note",
          "status": "hypothesis",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "sha256:63b02ed3758f4c7ef5ff29eeec64d394d78e30f630f0a9f0c2a7d41f2ac8c1dd",
            "sha256:c45311a48319d3bc4c61de2c6976eea76086867997df87a8e2ed7a56459fa968"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
